    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Spark Sense</h2><p><em>Some truths are louder than sound.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a skill rank in Occult (Mind). If you already have it, you gain mastery.</p><p>As an action, you may focus on the unseen and learn one of the following about a creature, object, or place within 6 squares (choose one):</p><ul><li>Whether it is suffused with magic-like resonance</li><li>Whether it feels aligned toward Renewal or toward Corruption (GM adjudication)</li><li>Whether it bears an active ward, curse, or binding</li></ul><p>You can use this principle a number of times equal to your skill rank bonus, regaining all uses on a Sanctuary.</p>",
